---
description: WebMCP implementation rules
globs:
  - "src/infrastructure/webmcp/**"
  - "providers/**"
alwaysApply: false
---
- Follow the current WebMCP specification.
- Prefer stable capability contracts over UI/DOM assumptions.
- Validate schemas and side-effect classes.
- Mutation tools are replay-safe.
- Provider reset/admin capabilities are never exposed to ordinary agent contexts.
- Post-mutation verification is mandatory.
